            "summary": "Raised concerns about inadequate COVID-19 safety protocols at school sites, including missing barriers, broken temperature equipment, parents walking in unannounced, improper PPE for custodians, loss of Google Voice for remote phone calls, and the requirement for some classified staff to be on-site when working from home should be permitted."
